# Memes excluded from the catalog. One fnmatch glob per line, matched against
# the path relative to this folder and against the bare filename. The files
# themselves are left alone - re-run `python analyze_memes.py` after editing.
#
# Examples:
#   Harold.jpg                       drops every Harold.jpg anywhere
#   Reactions/Horny/*                drops a whole folder
#   *Cursed*                         drops anything with Cursed in the path

Various & templates (no HD)/Reactions/Humm - Not interesting - Boring/Harold.jpg
